#BlueJ class context
comment0.target=Mole
comment0.text=\n\ A\ single\ entity\ \u2013\ either\ a\ MOLE\ or\ a\ BOMB\ \u2013\ that\ pops\ out\ of\ a\ hole.\n\n\ \ State\ machine\:\n\ \ \ \ RISING\ \ \u2192\ moves\ upward\ until\ fully\ visible\n\ \ \ \ SHOWING\ \u2192\ waits\ for\ a\ click\ or\ timeout\n\ \ \ \ FALLING\ \u2192\ retreats\ back\ into\ the\ hole\n\ \ \ \ DONE\ \ \ \ \u2192\ off-screen;\ safe\ to\ remove\n\n\ \ Visual\ trick\:\n\ \ \ \ draw()\ clips\ itself\ to\ y\ <\ holeY\ so\ the\ sprite\ only\ appears\ above\n\ \ \ \ the\ hole\ centre.\ \ GamePanel\ draws\ holes\ on\ top\ afterwards,\ which\n\ \ \ \ frames\ the\ exit\ point\ and\ completes\ the\ emerging-from-ground\ illusion.\n\n\ \ Animation\:\n\ \ \ \ While\ SHOWING,\ the\ entity\ wiggles\ (mole)\ or\ shakes\ (bomb)\ using\ a\ sine\ wave.\n\ \ \ \ Hit\ detection\ follows\ the\ animated\ position.\n
comment1.params=holeIndex\ cx\ holeY\ kind\ showTicks
