comment3.text=\n\ Draws\ the\ sprite\ with\ a\ horizontal\ offset\ (wiggle/shake)\ applied.\n\ The\ clip\ is\ still\ relative\ to\ the\ original\ holeY\ to\ keep\ the\ illusion.\n
